//                       `TacticState::MidBlock` independent of archetype.
//                       Per-team behavioral divergence becomes real (and
//                       earns trigger #3) at T2-1b/c when `BallInPlay` /
//                       `PossessionLost` / `BallRecovered` TacticEvent
//                       variants get emitted + consult per-team
//                       `archetype_params`. Goal envelope verified in
