//   2026-05-17 (T2-1b) — `5716e868...19e3` per ADR-0012 trigger #3
//                       (BEHAVIORAL change — per-team archetype divergence
//                       NOW actually fires). T2-1b wired the
//                       `PossessionLost` + `BallRecovered` `TacticEvent`
//                       emissions in `tick_match` that consult per-team
//                       `archetype_params` via the
//                       `emit_possession_transition_events` helper.
//                       Effect on this 600-tick run (home=attacking-fullback
//                       MidBlock-leaning, away=low-block-counter LowBlock-
//                       leaning): the two teams' tactic-FSMs now transition
//                       on cross-team possession changes per ITS OWN
//                       archetype's `press_intensity` + `counter_intent` —
//                       producing different `TeamTacticState` evolution
//                       across 600 ticks vs the pre-T2-1b run where both
//                       teams sat in MidBlock from kickoff to FullTime.
//                       This is the ADR-0012 trigger #3 behavioral
